</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}directed\\text{-}graph} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow\nE\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\n\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n1\\le n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n+1,X)\n\\land\\gamma(0)=\\gamma(n)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\gamma(i),\\gamma(i+1)\\rangle\\in E\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}directed\\text{-}graph} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow\nE\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\n\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n1\\le n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n+1,X)\n\\land\\gamma(0)=\\gamma(n)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\gamma(i),\\gamma(i+1)\\rangle\\in E\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是顶点集而非集合论宇宙；禁止任意正长度的闭有向游走等价于有向无环性，并同时排除自环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}